LAMMPS (30 Sep 2026)
# OpenKapitza direct NEMD -- Si/Al interface
# Generated; do not edit by hand. Units: metal (Angstrom, ps, eV, bar).
#
# Layout along z:
#   [wall][hot Langevin][ bulk Si ]|[ bulk Al ][cold Langevin][wall]
# z is NON-PERIODIC so heat cannot short-circuit around the box.

units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p f
atom_style      atomic
timestep        0.001000

# Heterostructure: diamond side A (6 cells, -0.29% in-plane) and
# fcc side B (8 cells, +0.29%) in a 32.4930 A square
# supercell. The box extends 5.00 A above the built cell for the
# piston (that space starts empty).
region          simbox block 0.0 32.4930 0.0 32.4930                 0.0 121.0000 units box
create_box      2 simbox
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (32.493 32.493 121)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
lattice         custom 1.0 a1 5.415500 0.0 0.0 a2 0.0 5.415500 0.0 a3 0.0 0.0 5.431000                 basis 0.0000 0.0000 0.0000                 basis 0.0000 0.5000 0.5000                 basis 0.5000 0.0000 0.5000                 basis 0.5000 0.5000 0.0000                 basis 0.2500 0.2500 0.2500                 basis 0.2500 0.7500 0.7500                 basis 0.7500 0.2500 0.7500                 basis 0.7500 0.7500 0.2500
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 5.4155 5.4155 5.431
region          side_a block INF INF INF INF INF 57.7044 units box
create_atoms    1 region side_a
